  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advise for harmonisation of Ukrainian law on nursery of perennial plants with European legislation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The analysis of the new Ukrainian law on the Nursery of Perennial Plants suggests implementing some recommendations. These changes will bring the Ukrainian legislation in line with European standards. All the proposed changes will have a positive impact on issues related to illegal propagation, import procedures, and phytosanitary requirements for planting material. Furthermore, it will enhance the Law on &quot;Rights on the Plant Varieties&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
